The espn_b68_pregame_*.json files (Build 68) are minimized copies of public ESPN
event-summary responses captured on 2026-11-13 for events that had not started
(header status state "pre"). They keep every field Kyro decodes for pregame context:
records, standings, last five games, season series, leaders, injuries, venue and the
season averages ESPN places under boxscore.teams before the start. Injuries and
news are cut to three entries per list.

